 265            /MAINLINE BASIC
 266            
 267            /WHENEVER THERE IS NOTHING BETTER TO DO OR A JOB WANTS TO
 268            /DISMISS ITSELF SO OTHERS CAN TRY THIS ROUTINE IS ENTERED
